  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nAt least as per the first test of https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/blob/main/LayoutTests/fast/forms/select-ask-for-reset.html (which I think Chromium has an equivalent of, but should really be upstreamed to WPT, and Chromium still passes), selectedness should only change if the `select` element \"owner\" ended up changing in some way.\n\nThis would also require changes to the DOM standard as we have to know the new/old parent of the subtree that got inserted/removed in order to determine whether something changed.\n\ncc @josepharhar ",
